Increases weapon damage by [29%, 42%, 51%, 59%, 66% (TL1-5)] and Physical Power by 30 when using steamguns.

When your bullets hit a target you instinctively reach out to the impact and use the kinetic force to project a mindstar attack doing [150%, 183%, 209%, 230%, 250% (TL1-5)] damage (guaranteed hit), if you wield one in the offhand.

This projection requires a pure mindstar; it will not work if extended into a psiblade.

Also activable for a shot that deals [134%, 153%, 167%, 179%, 190% (TL1-5)] weapon damage as mind damage.
